# =============================================================================
#  freshman -- anomaly-detection research repository
#
#  Tracked   : source code, frozen preregistrations/configs, lightweight result
#              tables (csv / json / md / txt / yaml) and environment pins.
#  Local only: raw datasets, model weights, GB-scale feature caches, map
#              renderings, temporary scratch output and run logs.
#
#  NOTE: results/ is deliberately NOT ignored wholesale. The frozen CSV/JSON
#  tables are the audit record of every closed gate and must stay in git; only
#  the bulky outputs are dropped. Ignores are by FILE TYPE, so a directory is
#  kept exactly when its contents are lightweight.
# =============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# datasets -- public and re-downloadable, never versioned. Path/config
# documentation lives in docs/ and configs/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
datasets/
mvtec/
visa/
MVTec*/
VisA*/
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# model weights -- never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.bin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# large numeric caches (feature banks, memmaps, dense layer traces)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.cache
*.f16

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# run logs and temporary scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
_tmp_*/
tmp/
temp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# packaging bundles (the loose files they contain are tracked individually)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_package.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# heavy result artefacts -- renderings, arrays and archives only.
# Small tables under results/**/*.{csv,json,md,txt,yaml,yml} are KEPT.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/**/*.png
results/**/*.jpg
results/**/*.jpeg
results/**/*.zip
results/**/*.npz
results/**/*.npy
results/**/*.pt
results/**/*.pth

# Oversized raw per-cell table (53 MB, over the 50 MB guidance). Its derived
# successor results/model_v0/metrics/r6a1f_layerwise/dense_layer_curve.csv is
# tracked, so the frozen layer-curve numbers remain auditable.
results/model_v0/metrics/r6a1f_layerwise/radius_profile_raw.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vendored upstream checkouts.
# AnomalyDINO is vendored as PLAIN FILES (its nested .git was removed) because
# it is a runtime dependency of the V3 pipeline and must be readable in-repo.
# Only upstream's own generated output is excluded. Provenance -- upstream URL,
# pinned commit, local modifications -- is recorded in third_party_patches/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/AnomalyDINO/results_MVTec/
third_party/MVTecAD2_code_utils/

# SubspaceAD is NOT vendored: it has local modifications, which are frozen as
# a patch instead (third_party_patches/subspacead.patch, upstream ef56d5c).
third_party/SubspaceAD/
